  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Women&rsquo;s MA-1 Flight Jacket delivers both style and functionality with a classic bomber jacket look tailored specifically for women. Featuring a 100% nylon water-repellent outer shell, this jacket offers protection from the elements, making it perfect for cooler climates. The fully reversible rescue orange polyester lining adds versatility and a pop of color, while the poly fiberfill ensures warmth without bulk.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
