  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Women&rsquo;s MA-1 Flight Jacket delivers both style and functionality with a classic bomber jacket look tailored specifically for women. Featuring a 100% nylon water-repellent outer shell, this jacket offers protection from the elements, making it perfect for cooler climates. The fully reversible rescue orange polyester lining adds versatility and a pop of color, while the poly fiberfill ensures warmth without bulk. Designed with ribbed knit collar, cuffs, and waistband for a snug, comfortable fit, this jacket also includes 2 front slash pockets and 2 inside pockets, offering ample storage for your essentials. A zippered utility pocket with an outside pencil pocket provides additional space for small items. The zippered front closure, complete with double MA-1 pull tabs and a storm flap, adds both style and weather protection. Brass zippers and leather pull tabs complete the jacket&rsquo;s timeless appeal, combining function with fashion for any occasion.</p>",
